 "path": "changelog/2026-04-partial-preset-apply.mdx",
 "frontmatter": {
  "title": "April 2026 - Partial Preset Apply",
  "description": "Apply only the theme or fonts from a preset while keeping your existing components.",
  "date": "2026-04-22T00:00:00.000Z"
 },
 "toc": [],
 "hast": "\n<p>You can now selectively apply a preset.</p>\n<p>Say someone shares a preset with you and you already have your own components, but you like the theme or the fonts. Now you can apply just that.</p>\n<p>Keep your components. Apply only what you want.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"# Apply the full preset.\nnpx shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4\n\n# Apply only the theme.\nnpx shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4 --only theme\n\n# Apply only the fonts.\nnpx shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4 --only font\n\n# Apply theme and fonts.\nnpx shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4 --only theme,font\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#8B8B8B94;--shiki-light:#6E7781\"># Apply the full preset.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> apply</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> b2D0vQ7G4</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#8B8B8B94;--shiki-light:#6E7781\"># Apply only the theme.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> apply</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> b2D0vQ7G4</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --only</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> theme</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#8B8B8B94;--shiki-light:#6E7781\"># Apply only the fonts.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> apply</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> b2D0vQ7G4</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --only</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> font</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#8B8B8B94;--shiki-light:#6E7781\"># Apply theme and fonts.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> apply</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> b2D0vQ7G4</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --only</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> theme,font</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>The default behavior is unchanged. Running <code>shadcn apply --preset &#x3C;preset></code> still applies the full preset.</p>\n<p>Partial preset apply currently supports <code>theme</code> and <code>font</code>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Button\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;asChild&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;size&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sm&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Link\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/create&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 no-underline!&#x22;}]\"><p>Try a Preset</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>"
}
